n of the U.S. embassy. Later, Mircea and Carmen attempt to cast doubts on Victor’s true motivations.","duration":49,"scws_id":683518,"season_id":10292,"created_at":"2025-09-30T11:36:11.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T00:18:38.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2026-02-20 01:18:37","images":[{"id":296542,"filename":"9ba7efff-efe4-408b-bcdc-9bd16a7f41b1.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":131151,"created_at":"2025-09-30T11:36:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T11:36:12.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/9ba7efff-efe4-408b-bcdc-9bd16a7f41b1.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":378474,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":131151,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 4"}]},{"id":131148,"number":5,"name":"Episodio 5","plot":"Upon learning that Ileana is being interrogated by Ceaușescu's men, Victor utilizes Ingrid's intel about an imminent bomb attack in Bonn to get a recorded message to his daughter.","duration":45,"scws_id":683519,"season_id":10292,"created_at":"2025-09-30T11:33:44.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T00:09:38.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":0,"sub_ita":1,"uploaded_at":"2026-02-20 01:09:37","images":[{"id":296509,"filename":"ad3bb001-6b3f-4a7d-9909-dbc47559600d.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":131148,"created_at":"2025-09-30T11:33:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T11:33:45.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/ad3bb001-6b3f-4a7d-9909-dbc47559600d.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":378446,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":131148,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Episodio 5"}]},{"id":131152,"number":6,"name":"Episodio 6","plot":"Though Victor's intel proves useful, the German police and CIA are left scrambling when a second target emerges. Amid the chaos, Victor and Frank attempt to neutralize the attacke